UID:patmos-easter-holy-week-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270426
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270427
SUMMARY:Easter (Holy Week)
LOCATION:Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Patmos's Easter is among the most spectacular in Greece — the monastery hosts the niptiras ceremony on Holy Thursday\, with the abbot ritually washing 12 monks' feet. Pilgrims from across the Orthodox world.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#easter-holy-week
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#easter-holy-week
END:VEVENT
