BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:patmos-niptiras-holy-thursday-foot-washing-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270429
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270430
SUMMARY:Niptiras (Holy Thursday foot-washing)
LOCATION:Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Open-air ceremony in Chora's main square: the abbot of the Monastery of Saint John ritually washes the feet of 12 monks\, reenacting Christ washing the disciples' feet. One of the few places in the Orthodox world where the rite is still performed publicly.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#niptiras-holy-thursday-foot-washing
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#niptiras-holy-thursday-foot-washing
END:VEVENT
