UID:patmos-kampos-panigiri-of-christos-transfiguration-kampos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Christos (Transfiguration)\, Kampos
LOCATION:Kampos\, Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The church of Christos in Kato Kampos celebrates the Transfiguration with a vespers on the 5th and a panigiri with music and dance run by the Kampos cultural association 'Evangelistria'\, spilling into the tavernas on Kampos beach. Easy: it is the island's main beach village.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#kampos-panigiri-of-christos-transfiguration-kampos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#kampos-panigiri-of-christos-transfiguration-kampos
END:VEVENT
