SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Geranou
LOCATION:Geranou (north Patmos)\, Patmos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The largest panigiri on Patmos\, at the old double chapel on the hilltop of Geranou\, north of Kampos\, with a view over the strait: after the vespers on the 14th thousands crowd the courtyard for food and wine and a traditional orchestra keeps the dancing going until dawn. Go by bus or scooter and expect to walk the last stretch\; cars queue on the narrow road.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/patmos/#geranou-north-patmos-panigiri-of-panagia-geranou
